        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Decide the final reply (automated answer vs human handoff), mark escalation\n// state and compute the outcome that is persisted and returned.\nconst env = $input.first().json;\nconst escalated = !!(env.escalation && env.escalation.requires_human);\n\nconst replyText = escalated\n  ? ((env.escalation && env.escalation.handoff_message) || 'Your request has been escalated to our human support team. A ticket has been created and someone will follow up soon.')\n  : ((env.response && env.response.text) || 'I apologize, but I could not generate a response. Our team has been notified.');\n\nconst resolution = escalated ? 'escalated' : (env.policy && env.policy.action === 'clarify' ? 'clarified' : 'automated');\n\nlet durationMs = null;\ntry {\n  const ts = new Date(env.timestamp);\n  if (!isNaN(ts.getTime())) durationMs = Date.now() - ts.getTime();\n} catch (e) {}\n\nconst finalize = {\n  reply: replyText,\n  requires_human: escalated,\n  escalated,\n  resolution,\n  validated: !!(env.validation && env.validation.valid),\n  rag_hit: !!(env.rag && env.rag.strong),\n  ticket_number: (env.escalation && env.escalation.ticket && env.escalation.ticket.ticket_number) || null,\n  duration_ms: durationMs,\n  intent: env.classification ? env.classification.intent : null,\n  confidence: env.classification ? env.classification.confidence : null,\n  sentiment: env.sentiment ? env.sentiment.sentiment : null,\n  priority: (env.policy && env.policy.priority) || (env.sentiment && env.sentiment.priority) || 'normal',\n  escalation_reason: (env.escalation && env.escalation.reason) || null\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...env, finalize } }];"
      },
